sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Attacker as Adversary (Proxy)
    participant Service as Service

    User->>Attacker: Request (HTTP/Compromised)
    Attacker->>Service: Request (Valid TLS)

    Service-->>Attacker: Response (Original)
    Attacker->>Attacker: Modify Content/Inject Malicious Script
    Attacker-->>User: Response (Modified)

    User->>Attacker: Submit Credentials/Data
    Attacker->>Attacker: Capture Data
    Attacker->>Service: Forward Credentials
